_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":80,"digest":"sha256:f6e4a7af24f2eb5dc66a54ced2eac2e7f9142c75466a17cd8e7c5c52a86a3bd0","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-10-29T20:37:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T20:37:53Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Oliv3rmoon/Datura/releases/download/01.001.001/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oliv3rmoon/Datura/tarball/01.001.001","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oliv3rmoon/Datura/zipball/01.001.001","body":"**Datura v1.001.001: renamed from Nightshade Stream.** Renamed to Datura; same app, same title ID, your settings stay.\n\n## What changed\n\n- **The name.** The PS5 home screen, the header, the About page, the update dialog, the stream's notifications and the on-screen keyboard say Datura, in all 31 languages. The About page keeps the Moonlight, Sunshine and ProsperoLight credits.\n- **Updates.** The app asks [Oliv3rmoon/Datura](https://github.com/Oliv3rmoon/Datura/releases) for a newer release. The old address, Oliv3rmoon/Nightshade-Stream, forwards there, so Nightshade Stream 01.001.000 finds this release and **Update now** installs it over itself.\n- **What stays.** The title ID (PPSA99002) and `/data/prosperolight`, so it installs over Nightshade Stream and keeps your PCs, pairing and settings. Streaming is as it was, built with the same measured settings. The release's files are named as before.\n\n## Install\n\n- `PPSA99002.zip`: choose **Update now** when Nightshade Stream or Datura offers this release, or close the app, extract the ZIP and copy its `PPSA99002` folder over your current one (`/data/homebrew/PPSA99002`). Your PCs, pairing and settings stay.\n- `SHA256SUMS`: the checksum of the download. `gh attestation verify PPSA99002.zip -R Oliv3rmoon/Datura` checks that this repository's workflow built it.\n\n## Thanks\n\nTo **BlackBearReloaded**, who created ProsperoLight, to its contributors **Nikita Dybov** and **Kris Escobar** and everyone who tests it, and to the **Moonlight** and **Sunshine** developers, whose protocol and host it streams with. The full list is in the [README](https://github.com/Oliv3rmoon/Datura#credits).\n"}